# "Whenever Lightning deals combat damage to a player": damage to a creature is not that. Bot2's Hill Giant (3/3) blocks Lightning
# (3/2, first strike, trample): Lightning's 3 first-strike damage must all go to the Giant (lethal damage is 3, so none tramples
# over) and kills it before it deals damage. There is no trigger, so a Lightning Bolt cast afterwards at Bot2 deals just 3 (17).

